---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="About Temporary Works Consulting — an independent NZ engineering practice focused on temporary works.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>An independent NZ practice, focused on temporary works.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Temporary Works Consulting is a chartered-engineer-led practice based in Porirua,
        working with main contractors, sub-contractors and designers across New Zealand.
      </p>

      <h2>Why &ldquo;independent&rdquo; matters.</h2>
      <p>
        Temporary works failures tend to come from concurrent pressures — programme, ground
        conditions, change. An independent design checker is paid to ask the awkward question
        before the awkward thing happens on site.
      </p>

      <h2>Standards we work to.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>BS 5975 — Code of practice for temporary works procedures.</li>
        <li>AS/NZS 1170 series — Structural design actions.</li>
        <li>NZS 3404 / AS 4100 — Steel structures.</li>
        <li>NZS 3101 — Concrete structures.</li>
        <li>BRE 470 — Working platforms for tracked plant.</li>
        <li>BS EN 12812 — Falsework performance requirements.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Insurances and accreditations.</h2>
      <p>
        Professional indemnity and public liability insured. Engineering New Zealand chartered
        membership. Happy to share certificates on request.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .narrow { max-width: 760px; }
</style>
